# Wix headless data client. Create a Wix Headless project / OAuth app for the
# VGP content site and paste its Client ID here. Without it, the site renders
# with editorial-review seed content (so pages build and look right now); with
# it, live CMS content flows in.
PUBLIC_WIX_CLIENT_ID=

# Approved public fit-call scheduling URL (the ONLY public Calendly).
# Rendered server-side, only on the qualified advisory-pathway result.
FIT_CALL_URL=https://calendly.com/valugrowthpartners/vgp-insight-session

# Cross-brand Brand Blueprint URL (staging or live).
BB_URL=https://the-brand-blueprint.myshopify.com
